        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "We had as situation come up recently, and I wanted some opinions.  We were playing against Baron Blade, and one of my buddies was playing Mister Fixer.  He had Pipe Wrench (out first) and Driving Mantis.  Baron Blade got out a Backlash Field.  Thus the question arose... when Baron Blade deals 3 backlash damage, can you have the Pipe Wrench reduce it by 1 (to 2) and then redirect it with Driving Mantis?  The order of processing effects (since Pipe Wrench was down first) seems to make this ok, but somehow I thought that all redirections and stuff happened first, and then reductions didn't happen until you were actually taking the damage.\n\nWhat are ya'll's thoughts?",
