      {
        "id": 29164,
        "name": "broccoli",
        "username": "broccoli",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-29T21:09:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, given your directions, it would go like this:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Source is Baron Blade</li>\n<li>Initial target is Mister Fixer</li>\n<li>No increase or reduction</li>\n<li>Reduce damage by 1 to 2</li>\n<li>Driving Mantis lets you redirect to someone else (say, the Baron)</li>\n<li>Remove the reduction, so 2 becomes 3</li>\n<li>No increase/reduction</li>\n</ol>\n<p>So in the end the Baron Blade takes 3 damage?</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:03:07.929Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
