        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "So, given your directions, it would go like this:\n\n1. Source is Baron Blade\n2. Initial target is Mister Fixer\n3. No increase or reduction\n4. Reduce damage by 1 to 2\n5. Driving Mantis lets you redirect to someone else (say, the Baron)\n6. Remove the reduction, so 2 becomes 3\n7. No increase/reduction\n\nSo in the end the Baron Blade takes 3 damage?",
